<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Battle Dots Clash</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      background: linear-gradient(160deg, #020617, #0f172a);
      color: #f8fafc;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .tagline {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #38bdf8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .description {
      text-align: center;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: 0 auto 40px;
    }

    .section {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: #f8fafc;
    }

    ul {
      padding-left: 20px;
      margin: 0;
      color: #cbd5e1;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .closing {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #facc15;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <h1>Battle Dots Clash</h1>

    <div class="tagline">
      Every shot matters.
    </div>

    <p class="description">
      Battle Dots Clash is a fast-paced arcade strategy game where physics,
      timing, and smart decisions determine how long you survive.
      Absorb ally dots, destroy enemies, manage your moves carefully,
      and climb the ranks through increasingly difficult battles.
    </p>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>How to Play</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Pull, aim, and launch your player dot</li>
        <li>Absorb ally dots to gain power</li>
        <li>Destroy enemy dots before they destroy you</li>
        <li>Collect moves dots to extend your run</li>
        <li>Use strategy — every shot changes the board</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Special Dots & Effects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Blast — clears enemies in a powerful explosion</li>
        <li>Split — creates temporary clone dots</li>
        <li>Shield — protects you from incoming damage</li>
        <li>Random dots — unpredictable effects and values</li>
        <li>Danger dots — high-risk targets that can end runs quickly</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>What Makes It Different</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Physics-based gameplay with satisfying collisions</li>
        <li>Strategic resource management using limited moves</li>
        <li>Fast-paced “one more try” arcade progression</li>
        <li>Tier rankings based on performance and efficiency</li>
        <li>Every level creates new tactical decisions</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Progress & Challenge</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Difficulty increases as you survive longer</li>
        <li>Persistent checkpoints help you push further</li>
        <li>Efficiency and combos improve your final rank</li>
        <li>Climb through evolving tiers and tougher boards</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2>Retro Arcade Feel</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Clean neon-inspired visuals</li>
        <li>Retro-style soundtrack and effects</li>
        <li>Fast restarts and instant gameplay</li>
        <li>Designed for quick sessions or long runs</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="closing">
      How far can you climb before one bad shot ends the run?
    </div>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
